      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a formal letter to my local school board? i'm pretty upset about this new sexuality education curriculum they're trying to push. i want to argue that parents should have the final say in what their kids are taught about these sensitive topics and that the school shouldn't be overstepping that boundary. just make it sound professional and firm.",
